graph TD
    A[Bill Details] --> B[Validate Bill]
    B -->|Invalid| ERR1[Return Error]
    B -->|Valid| C[Three-Way Match]
    C -->|Mismatch| F1[Manual Review]
    C -->|Matched| D[Create Bill Record]
    D -->|Error| ERR2[Return Error]
    D -->|Success| E{Approval Required?}
    E -->|Yes| F[Approve Bill]
    E -->|No| G[Schedule Payment]
    F -->|Rejected| H[Return to Draft]
    F -->|Approved| G
    G -->|Error| ERR3[Return Error]
    G -->|Success| DONE[Bill Processed]

    style ERR1 fill:#f96
    style ERR2 fill:#f96
    style ERR3 fill:#f96
    style F1 fill:#ff9
    style H fill:#ff9
    style DONE fill:#9f9
